/**
 * The two closed documents `benchmark/trace2skill.ts` reads and writes: the Tangle-authored MIT fixture (tasks, disjoint evolve/test splits, the frozen human skill directory, the scripted wire, the registered patch pool and the oracle expectations) and the keyless report (split identities, run identity, the deepening and creation tables, the analytic oracle, the registered probes, every counted failure and the capability gates derived from rows and probes). TypeScript is generated from this document by `@jarenjs/emit`; the arithmetic an honest report depends on binds here through `$query` at validation time. Every object closes its properties, so credential material or an undeclared member cannot be carried, and no member anywhere holds a clock reading.
 */
export type Trace2skill = Trace2skillFixture | TaskDocument | TruthDocument | PatchDocument | MergeTreeDocument | LabelsDocument | OracleDocument | ScopeDocument | ScriptDocument | Trace2skillReport;

